{"id": "msg_b6f23aedf98841428d3786026a166af2", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "chatcmpl-tool-914b559a646a0e0d", "tool_name": "ops_bash", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[cwd: resolvedFrom=\"D:\\\\repository\\\\skills\"; cwdSource=\"workingDirectory\"]\n{\r\n  \"generated_at\": \"2026-11-27T19:34:34+08:00\",\r\n  \"total_memories\": 6690,\r\n  \"eligible\": 3873,\r\n  \"picked\": 45,\r\n  \"candidates\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"uri\": \"viking://user/default/memories/entities/dsh插件/dsh_token_guard.md\",\r\n      \"cooldown_note\": \"never_checked\",\r\n      \"frontmatter\": {},\r\n      \"body_sha256_16\": \"fc55a23bb557bd08\",\r\n      \"content\": \"# dsh-token-guard\\nDSH local plugin that enforces token-cost guardrails and hard-truncates oversized tool results; source at D:/repository/skills/dsh/token-guard/lib/index.js, symlinked from ~/.dsh/token-guard, zero-dependency (imports no @deepseek-ai/*), wired into the web profile as a pnpm file: dependency.\\n\\n## Files and role\\n- Ships lib/index.js, selftest.mjs, selftest-cordis.mjs and cordis.patch.yml.\\n- Original duties: grep folding, read gating, pwsh build/lint/test output capping (capPwsh triggers only for BUILD_CMD).\\n- Complements agent-guard (pwsh POSIX pre-check), dsh-cost-meter (interactive merge) and dsh-spill-policy (read/grep/skill big-result governance); targets the biggest waste item from the 2026-11-12 token-cost analysis (pwsh Get-Content on source files flooding the context).\\n\\n## Truncation rules (as of 2026-11-10)\\n- grep: 2026-11-11 起折叠改为组合条件（文件数≥5 且命中数≥30），返回行号；带 -C/-A/-B 参数时不折叠（旧规则：超过 10 文件或 20 行折叠）。\\n- read: over 500 lines truncated with an offset/limit or grep hint; skill bodies over 2,500 chars keep only the head plus a truncation note；2026-11-11 vue 门禁放宽到 500 行。\\n- pwsh: npm run lint/build/test errors over 20 lines keep the first 10 and last 5 lines.\\n- orchestrate: returns over 1000 chars containing \\\"无法读取\\\"/\\\"示意\\\" are cut to 1000 chars.\\n\\n## Rework (2026-11-12)\\n- capPwsh now returns {text, spillRequested, omittedLines}; read-type commands (Get-Content/Select-String/Get-ChildItem/gc/cat/type/more) are trimmed as well.\\n- Read-type output up to 200 lines passes through; larger output keeps head 120 + tail 40, folds the middle as \\\"省略N行\\\" and spills the full text to disk for read-back.\\n- New config pwshReadMaxLines/pwshHeadLines/pwshTailLines (defaults 200/120/40); build-branch trimming stays byte-identical (npm test baseline must pass); text:null means unchanged; a failed spill returns bounded text.\\n\\n## Activation failure and fix (2026-11-13)\\n- Commit 11c9ae67 added `ctx.p0LogReader = logStore.read;` at lib/index.js:393; the cordis 4.1.0 Context proxy set trap throws `cannot set property \\\"p0LogReader\\\" without provide` for undeclared properties, so the plugin failed to activate (1 entry did not activate) — same family as orchestrator-gate's 2026-11-12 \\\"cannot get property without inject\\\".\\n- Fix: call ctx.provide?.('p0LogReader') before the assignment when available (auto-reclaimed with the fiber), else fall back to a direct assignment \n\n[...]\n\n现象\\n- 资金缴款选「收入类别名称」超 10 条后不再显示，经营资产租赁合同、资产租赁合同备案、停车泊位合同备案、手工记账等页同样现象\\n- 左侧列表下方还有一片留白，默认铺满失效\\n\\n## 根因\\n- zs-select-dialog 左侧列表 pageSize 被写死为 10，容器高度足以显示二三十条却只装 10 条\\n- 容器未溢出，scroll-view / 滚动事件永不触发，「加载更多」走不到\\n- 与 #388（布局宽度/空态）和 #519（v-if 懒挂载不拉数）根因不同：此处确实拉了数据、仅首屏条数写死且无续拉\\n\\n## 解决方案\\n- 首屏 pageSize 由左侧列表容器高度动态计算，不再取常量 10\\n- 首次加载后若未铺满且仍有数据，自动续拉下一页直到铺满或取尽\\n- 监听滚动接近底部时继续分页加载\\n- 首次查询放到弹窗打开后的 $nextTick 中发起，保证算到真实容器高度\\n- 必须同时改 zs-select-dialog-func.vue（函数式）与 zs-select-dialog.vue（模板式 #define），否则函数式打开的页仍异常\\n\\n## 发布与验证\\n- 发布须同步 develop/v2.6.2-suzhufang、develop/v2.6.2、develop/v2.6.1，冲突分支手动 cherry-pick 提交号 cb5ef3166\\n- 验证证据：会话 5fa377d6（基线 fb3e960），结论为动态分页+自动铺满+滚动加载+$nextTick 首查\\n- 涉及文件：zs-select-dialog.vue、zs-select-dialog-func.vue、pubPaymentNotice/detail.vue、businessItemDialog.vue\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"uri\": \"viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/notice_empty_center.md\",\r\n      \"cooldown_note\": \"never_checked\",\r\n      \"frontmatter\": {},\r\n      \"body_sha256_16\": \"2be9e190f2d37633\",\r\n      \"content\": \"# 公示公告空状态居中修复\\n产品2.0 首页公示公告空状态现已在内容区内水平、垂直居中显示。\\n\\n## 问题根因\\n- `.notice-body` 原未占满剩余高度，空状态未居中\\n\\n## 解决方案\\n- `.notice-body` 改为 flex 纵向布局，占满剩余高度\\n- `.empty-tip` 使用 `flex: 1` 并配合 `align-items`/`justify-content: center` 实现居中\\n\\n## 验证与归属\\n- 刷新后「暂无公告数据」显示在区域正中央\\n- 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=产品2.0\\n- 涉及文件：`home/index-new.vue`、`home/index-wrapper.vue`、`layout/components/AppMain.vue`、`layout/index.vue`\\n- 来源会话：0ae813a4-8369-4c2b-a411-ca813e60468b；代码基线：none\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"uri\": \"viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/dialog_drag_fix.md\",\r\n      \"cooldown_note\": \"never_checked\",\r\n      \"frontmatter\": {},\r\n      \"body_sha256_16\": \"d3147953821d9bfb\",\r\n      \"content\": \"# v-dialogDrag弹窗撑满修复\\n苏州市房地产监测V3 中 `v-dialogDrag` 指令导致弹窗被拉满全屏，已修复为居中且可选关闭拖拽。\\n\\n## 根因\\n- `src/directives/dialog/drag.js` 挂载时给 `.el-dialog` 写 `position:absolute` 及 `inset:0`，弹窗撑满 wrapper（约1300×987）\\n- 与 `height:auto`、compact 类无关，是拖拽指令撑满盒子\\n\\n## 修改\\n- 重写 `drag.js`：用 `top:15vh`+`left:50%`+`translateX(-50%)` 居中，拖拽用 `getBoundingClientRect` 计算\\n- `zs-select-dialog`/`zs-select-dialog-func` 增加 `:draggable=\\\"false\\\"` 避免被指令改写尺寸\\n\\n## 后续跟进（来源会话 bbc55614-1928-472e-9700-f59ccfc62415）\\n- 当前 select-dialog 已改为 flex 垂直居中，不再使用 `15vh`；原先「双重下移」问题主要落在仍带 `select-dialog` 且默认可拖拽的用法上。\\n- `zs-dialog.vue` 新增 `dialogDragEnabled`：select-dialog 时一律关闭 `v-dialogDrag`，避免与 `drag.js` 的 `absolute + top: 15vh` 和居中布局冲突（如 `RegulatoryAccountDialog` 等未写 `:draggable=\\\"false\\\"` 的场景）。\\n- `select-dialog` 默认 `top: '0'`：未显式传 `top` 时写入 attrs，避免 Element 默认 `margin-top` 干扰居中。\\n- 新增 `--zs-dialog-select-wrapper-padding` 写在选择弹窗 wrapper / compact 上，统一上下留白与 `max-height` 计算。\\n\\n## 验证与归属\\n- 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=苏州市房地产监测V3\\n- 涉及文件：drag.js、zs-select-dialog.vue、zs-select-dialog-func.vue、detail.vue 等\\n- 来源会话：003d6075-c1af-4232-b337-c044d45c5078\"\r\n    }\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n\n[exit code: 0]\n\n(Omitted 53451 bytes. Full formatted result stored at: C:\\Users\\ADMINI~1\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\dsh-spill-vBjhs7\\session-dc9379b23eb5\\1ff8afe0eb1a-ops_bash.txt. Use read with offset/limit, or grep this path to search within it.)", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_b6f23aedf98841428d3786026a166af2", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 5931, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "2026-11-27T11:34:34.397Z", "peer_id": "github.com-tyvt-skills"}
