{"id": "msg_29146bf0eb5d449cad61f3f2090ec4de", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "chatcmpl-tool-9521a62504a8a0f9", "tool_name": "ops_inspect_local_file", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[cwd: resolvedFrom=D:\\repository\\skills; cwdSource=workingDirectory.]\n=== FILE: C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.dsh\\cache\\memory-audit\\_dump.txt (Lines 1-120 of 825) ===\n[Notice: revision=413bec3c1796ca9f3020dfc9e4c14bcdc081c67fe6c58f1ff215c5b9f9ded259; bytes=55042.]\n1 | ===== [0] fc55a23bb557bd08 =====\n2 | URI: viking://user/default/memories/entities/dsh插件/dsh_token_guard.md\n3 | # dsh-token-guard\n4 | DSH local plugin that enforces token-cost guardrails and hard-truncates oversized tool results; source at D:/repository/skills/dsh/token-guard/lib/index.js, symlinked from ~/.dsh/token-guard, zero-dependency (imports no @deepseek-ai/*), wired into the web profile as a pnpm file: dependency.\n5 | \n6 | ## Files and role\n7 | - Ships lib/index.js, selftest.mjs, selftest-cordis.mjs and cordis.patch.yml.\n8 | - Original duties: grep folding, read gating, pwsh build/lint/test output capping (capPwsh triggers only for BUILD_CMD).\n9 | - Complements agent-guard (pwsh POSIX pre-check), dsh-cost-meter (interactive merge) and dsh-spill-policy (read/grep/skill big-result governance); targets the biggest waste item from the 2026-11-12 token-cost analysis (pwsh Get-Content on source files flooding the context).\n10 | \n11 | ## Truncation rules (as of 2026-11-10)\n12 | - grep: 2026-11-11 起折叠改为组合条件（文件数≥5 且命中数≥30），返回行号；带 -C/-A/-B 参数时不折叠（旧规则：超过 10 文件或 20 行折叠）。\n13 | - read: over 500 lines truncated with an offset/limit or grep hint; skill bodies over 2,500 chars keep only the head plus a truncation note；2026-11-11 vue 门禁放宽到 500 行。\n14 | - pwsh: npm run lint/build/test errors over 20 lines keep the first 10 and last 5 lines.\n15 | - orchestrate: returns over 1000 chars containing \"无法读取\"/\"示意\" are cut to 1000 chars.\n16 | \n17 | ## Rework (2026-11-12)\n18 | - capPwsh now returns {text, spillRequested, omittedLines}; read-type commands (Get-Content/Select-String/Get-ChildItem/gc/cat/type/more) are trimmed as well.\n19 | - Read-type output up to 200 lines passes through; larger output keeps head 120 + tail 40, folds the middle as \"省略N行\" and spills the full text to disk for read-back.\n20 | - New config pwshReadMaxLines/pwshHeadLines/pwshTailLines (defaults 200/120/40); build-branch trimming stays byte-identical (npm test baseline must pass); text:null means unchanged; a failed spill returns bounded text.\n21 | \n22 | ## Activation failure and fix (2026-11-13)\n23 | - Commit 11c9ae67 added `ctx.p0LogReader = logStore.read;` at lib/index.js:393; the cordis 4.1.0 Context proxy set trap throws `cannot set property \"p0LogReader\" without provide` for undeclared properties, so the plugin failed to activate (1 entry did not activate) — same family as orchestrator-gate's 2026-11-12 \"cannot get property without inject\".\n24 | - Fix: call ctx.provide?.('p0LogReader') before the assignment when available (auto-reclaimed with the fiber), else fall back to a \n\n[...]\n\n正则（/[,，\\\\s\\\\u00A0\\\\u202F]/g，覆盖中英文逗号与各类不间断空格空白）先去分组符，再按当前选区拼进已有值，最后对整段再统一去一次分组符\n68 | - 重写 value 前先算 prefixCleanLen，用 requestAnimationFrame 恢复光标位置避免错位\n69 | - 核心结论：凡「先插入、后异步清洗」的输入处理都会被 maxlength 抢先截断，清洗必须前移到 preventDefault 之后的同步阶段\n70 | \n71 | ## 验证与归属\n72 | - 会话 9c57feb1 结论：onpaste 改为 preventDefault + clipboardData 取原文 + stripMoneyGrouping 先清洗再拼值，修复「1,111,111 被卡成 1111」\n73 | - 涉及文件：src/directives/formatter/money.js；所属项目：产品2.0；来源会话：9c57feb1-7d80-4322-82da-ffd6c882352d；代码基线：8d416b2\n74 | \n75 | ===== [3] 279abd7ba9a7edf1 =====\n76 | URI: viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/dialog_left_double_spacing.md\n77 | # 全局样式导致对话框左侧面板出现双倍间距\n78 | 在苏州市房地产监测V3中，全局`zs-dialog`为`.dialog-left`定义了`margin-right: 20px; padding: 20px`；组件的新样式优先级相同且未覆盖该全局样式，导致左侧面板出现双倍间距。\n79 | \n80 | ## 问题根因\n81 | - `zs-select-dialog.vue`中的全局`.dialog-left`定义了`margin-right: 20px; padding: 20px`\n82 | - 组件的新样式优先级相同，未能替换全局样式\n83 | \n84 | ## 解决方案\n85 | - `BuildingUnitLazyTree.vue`使用选择器`.dialog-box .dialog-left.building-unit-lazy-tree` (0,4,0)\n86 | - `ContractDialog.vue`、`NoticeContractDialog.vue`、`buildingTreeDialog.vue`添加类`select-contract-dialog`/`select-notice-dialog`，并统一body的padding与面板的`gap: 16px`\n87 | \n88 | ## 验证与归属\n89 | - 验证证据: src=苏州市房地产监测V3/254.md\n90 | - 涉及文件: chooseHouseDialog.vue, BuildingUnitLazyTree.vue, ContractDialog.vue, buildingTreeDialog.vue, NoticeContractDialog.vue, HouseSelectDialog.vue, zs-select-dialog.vue, BuildingDialog.vue\n91 | - 所属项目: 苏州市房地产监测V3; Session: 7342d846-a274-472d-aa53-0402cfe58bdb; Baseline: none\n92 | \n93 | ===== [4] 462e4219eac9a29a =====\n94 | URI: viking://user/default/memories/entities/前端技术笔记/class_mismatch_bug.md\n95 | # 复制改造页面布局错乱（类名不匹配）\n96 | 园区物管2.0 中复制或改造列表页后，因模板类名与样式类名对不上导致布局完全错乱的已知问题。\n97 | \n98 | ## 现象\n99 | - 改造/复制既有列表页（如 serviceItem/index.vue）后，左侧分类与右侧表格布局完全错乱，调样式无效。\n100 | - CSS 不报错、元素照样渲染，易被误判为样式权重或组件默认样式问题反复排查。\n101 | \n102 | ## 根因\n103 | - 模板结构类名（type-main-box、type-left）与 <style> 中的样式类名（sort-main-box、sort-left）对不上，样式规则未命中。\n104 | - 通常源于分支合并/复制时模板改了类名而样式没同步（v2.6.1→v2.6.2 改造残留）。\n105 | \n106 | ## 排查与修复\n107 | - 遇到「样式完全没生效/布局乱」先做模板类名与样式选择器的双向 grep 对账，而非先怀疑样式权重。\n108 | - 确认是分支残留时，直接从上一个正常版本（v2.6.1）恢复该页布局最稳。\n109 | - 修复需同步提交到所有在用的发布分支（develop/v2.6.2 与 v2.6.2-yulin）。\n110 | \n111 | ## 关联信息\n112 | - 涉及文件：zhi2-web-admin/src/views/property/serviceItem/detail.vue、complexService/components/complexServiceDetailDialog.vue；代码基线 c52866fc8。\n113 | - 验证：262 分支 serviceItem/index.vue 模板用 type-* 但样式写在 sort-*；已从 v2.6.1 恢复并提交到 develop/v2.6.2（62b5647c8）与 develop/v2.6.2-yulin（347237709）。\n114 | \n115 | ===== [5] 4085480137ceab93 =====\n116 | URI: viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/popup_textarea_full.md\n117 | # 弹窗两列布局中文本域整行规则\n118 | 苏州市房地产监测V3 项目在弹窗内将表单全局改为两列，但文本域（备注等）仍保持整行一列，未被压成半宽。\n119 | \n120 | ## 规则依据\n[Notice: 120 items displayed; complete=false; TruncatedBy: worker-limit; 