能力\"）。要跑构建/命令/读盘请用 op:\"full\"。\n\n    模型池: workbuddy/hy4flash-free -> auto/hy4flash-free", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_e2dfb4918a614bcea1a54f100725570f", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 1814, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "2026-11-27T11:35:40.250Z", "peer_id": "github.com-tyvt-skills"}
